{"777470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Infinite Black 2", "steam_appid": 777470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Exclusive Steam Gifts!</h1><p>Steam players receive 7 days of +10% Xp Bonus, two custom Captain Titles ​and an exclusive Scorpion Retro Ship Skin. <strong>These are valuable items you can use or sell -- Don't scrap them!</strong><br><i>Gifts delivered once you reach Captain Level 7.</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wildly popular online space adventure returns with a gorgeous new sequel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain a fleet of ships to hunt aliens, trade resources, loot treasure and earn thousands of achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form powerful corporations with your friends, build shipyards, then fight a never-ending intergalactic war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single cross-platform server connects thousands of players on all desktop and mobile devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord for dev chats and launch events! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Steam Deck Compatible!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wildly popular online space adventure returns with a gorgeous new sequel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain a fleet of ships to hunt aliens, trade resources, loot treasure and earn thousands of achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form powerful corporations with your friends, build shipyards, then fight a never-ending intergalactic war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single cross-platform server connects thousands of players on all desktop and mobile devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on D